<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Shelley returns three months after resection of a grade 1 meningioma. The MRI five days ago shows no residual or recurrent tumor, the swelling has resolved, and there is only a small scar under the craniotomy. She finished occupational therapy, and her right hand now feels as it did years ago; she writes for two to three hours each morning. She has had no seizure for sixteen weeks. The irritability has faded, and she has seen the counselor six times, talking about the illness and about old losses she has never spoken of to a clinician. Dr. Ferreira-Lindgren saw her after the scan and found no reason, from the surgery, against driving. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>MRI</td><td>No residual or recurrent tumor; edema resolved</td></tr><tr><td>Seizures</td><td>None for sixteen weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Hand</td><td>Full strength; writing two to three hours a day</td></tr><tr><td>Mood</td><td>Irritability faded; six counselor sessions</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
