    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No seizures, aura, weakness, or headaches</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood better; no irritability; no thoughts of suicide</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Energy back; weight stable</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Scar healed</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

